From 54f401e0f9da4788c23c3655a6706040876b087a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ada Example <ada@example.org>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:24:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Format money with Intl and simplify order helpers

The order helpers formatted amounts by hand ("12.5 EUR") and looped
where reduce and find say the same in one line. Amounts now go through
formatMoney, which uses Intl.NumberFormat, so they follow the locale.

The legacy name formatter is gone; nothing used it any more. README
moves to docs/, scripts/build.sh stops on the first error and
src/indent.js is re-indented (whitespace only).

Reviewed-by: Grace Hopper <grace@example.org>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
